    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS  are thrilled to bring to the market this beautifully presented two-bedroom apartment has been recently refurbished throughout and offers bright, contemporary accommodation in the highly sought-after Mount Oval Village development.\r\n\r\nImportantly, there is no rental cap in place, making this apartment an attractive proposition for investors, including purchasers using a self-invested pension fund. \r\n\r\nWhether for a first-time buyer, downsizer or investor. this attractive apartment represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a turnkey property in a well-established and highly regarded development. \r\n\r\nThe property has been finished to a high standard, creating a stylish and comfortable home that is ready for immediate occupation. The well-proportioned accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hallway, a spacious open-plan living and dining area, a modern fitted kitchen, two generous bedrooms, and a contemporary ensuite & main bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe open-plan living space provides an excellent setting for both relaxing and entertaining, with plenty of natural light creating a bright and inviting atmosphere. Both bedrooms are well proportioned and offer excellent storage, while the recently refurbished interiors give the apartment a fresh, modern feel throughout.\r\n\r\nLocated within the popular Mount Oval Village development, the apartment benefits from a peaceful residential setting while being conveniently positioned close to a wide range of amenities. Douglas, Rochestown and Cork City are all easily accessible, with excellent transport links, local shops, cafés, schools and recreational facilities nearby.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate the quality, presentation and location of this fine apartment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Rooms",
        "SortOrder": 2,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - \r\nLaminate flooring with storage press.\r\n\r\nKitchen / Living room - 6.5m x 3.4m \r\nLaminate flooring, fully fitted kitchen with stainless steel sink & drainer , electric oven, fridge freezer, washing machine and dryer. There is a glass door out to a balcony overlooking Mount Oval square.\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 - 4.8m x 3.0m \r\nLaminate flooring, Built in wardrobe, window overlooking Mount Oval square.\r\n\r\nEnsuite bathroom - 2.0m x 1.3m \r\nExtensively tiled, 3 piece suite.\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 - 3.2m x 2.3m \r\nLaminate flooring, Built in wardrobe, window overlooking Mount Oval square.\r\n\r\nBathroom - 2.5m x 2.0m \r\n\r\n\r\n"
